---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<html lang="zh-TW">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`About | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="About Liz Chen" />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main class="container">
			<div class="about">
				<img
					src="https://lizchen.co/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/021c6o8.png?w=1003"
					alt="Liz Chen"
					class="avatar"
				/>
				<div class="bio">
					<p>哈囉，我叫 Liz Chen，因為喜歡貝果所以命名為 Bagel Note。這裡會記錄一些我的讀書觀影心得，跟日常瑣事等等。如果需要聯繫或說笑話，可以發電子郵件給我：<a href="mailto:hi@lizchen.co">hi@lizchen.co</a></p>
					<p class="links">
						<a href="https://mastodon.social/@summer___ends" target="_blank">Mastodon</a>
						<span class="sep">|</span>
						<a href="https://letterboxd.com/lizchen/" target="_blank">Letterboxd</a>
						<span class="sep">|</span>
						<a href="https://www.serializd.com/user/lizchen/profile" target="_blank">Serialized</a>
						<span class="sep">|</span>
						<a href="https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/3888211-liz-chen" target="_blank">GoodReads</a>
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	main {
		padding-top: 2rem;
		padding-bottom: 3rem;
	}
	.about {
		display: flex;
		gap: 2.5rem;
		align-items: flex-start;
	}
	.avatar {
		width: 200px;
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}
	.bio {
		padding-top: 0.25rem;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		line-height: 1.75;
	}
	.bio p {
		margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
	}
	.links {
		color: var(--fg-muted);
		font-size: 0.875rem;
	}
	.links a {
		color: var(--fg);
	}
	.sep {
		margin: 0 0.4rem;
		color: var(--border);
	}

	@media (max-width: 580px) {
		.about {
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 1.5rem;
		}
		.avatar {
			width: 140px;
		}
	}
</style>
